(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Statement: A system has 5 processes \(P0 to P4\) and 3 resource types A \(10) Tj
T*
(instances\), B \(5 instances\), C \(7 instances\). Current Allocation and Max Need matrices) Tj
T*
(are given:) Tj
T*
(* Allocation: P0=\(0,1,0\), P1=\(2,0,0\), P2=\(3,0,2\), P3=\(2,1,1\), P4=\(0,0,2\). Sum) Tj
T*
(allocated = \(7, 2, 5\).) Tj
T*
(* Max Matrix: P0=\(7,5,3\), P1=\(3,2,2\), P2=\(9,0,2\), P3=\(2,2,2\), P4=\(4,3,3\).) Tj
T*
(* Calculate: Available Vector and verify if the system is in a Safe State by finding) Tj
T*
(the Safe Sequence.) Tj
T*
(Mathematical Execution:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Available Vector = Total - Allocated = \(10,5,7\) - \(7,2,5\) = \(3, 3, 2\).) Tj
T*
(* 2. Calculate Need Matrix \(Need = Max - Allocation\):) Tj
T*
(- Need P0 = \(7,5,3\) - \(0,1,0\) = \(7, 4, 3\)) Tj
T*
(- Need P1 = \(3,2,2\) - \(2,0,0\) = \(1, 2, 2\)) Tj
T*
(- Need P2 = \(9,0,2\) - \(3,0,2\) = \(6, 0, 0\)) Tj
T*
(- Need P3 = \(2,2,2\) - \(2,1,1\) = \(0, 1, 1\)) Tj
T*
(- Need P4 = \(4,3,3\) - \(0,0,2\) = \(4, 3, 1\)) Tj
T*
(* 3. Safety Algorithm Iterations:) Tj
T*
(- Iteration 1: Check P1: Need \(1,2,2\) <= Available \(3,3,2\) -> TRUE! P1 executes,) Tj
T*
(releases allocation. New Available = \(3,3,2\) + \(2,0,0\) = \(5, 3, 2\).) Tj
T*
(- Iteration 2: Check P3: Need \(0,1,1\) <= Available \(5,3,2\) -> TRUE! P3 executes,) Tj
T*
(releases allocation. New Available = \(5,3,2\) + \(2,1,1\) = \(7, 4, 3\).) Tj
T*
(- Iteration 3: Check P0: Need \(7,4,3\) <= Available \(7,4,3\) -> TRUE! P0 executes,) Tj
T*
(releases allocation. New Available = \(7,4,3\) + \(0,1,0\) = \(7, 5, 3\).) Tj
T*
(- Iteration 4: Check P2: Need \(6,0,0\) <= Available \(7,5,3\) -> TRUE! P2 executes,) Tj
T*
(releases allocation. New Available = \(7,5,3\) + \(3,0,2\) = \(10, 5, 5\).) Tj
T*
(- Iteration 5: Check P4: Need \(4,3,1\) <= Available \(10,5,5\) -> TRUE! P4 executes. New) Tj
T*
(Available = \(10, 5, 7\).) Tj
T*
(* 4. Safe Sequence Found: < P1, P3, P0, P2, P4 >. The system is provably DEADLOCK) Tj
T*
(FREE.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
